From 063418e27062dcf9dc2cdd7b76fbe5c185ae3279 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jeff Hughes <jeff@skillsamurai.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Mar 2026 07:54:19 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Handoff cleanup: restructure repo, add owner docs, archive
 build reports

- Move build reports to docs/build-reports/ (AUDIT_REPORT, DALLAS_SCENARIO_REPORT, etc.)
- Remove orphan zorspace-landing.html (incorporated into React app)
- Add HANDOFF_CHECKLIST.docx with 6-section transfer checklist
- Add OWNERS_MANUAL.docx with maintenance, brand onboarding, demo, and key rotation guides
- Update _MANIFEST.md to reflect new structure
- Harden .gitignore (add .claude/, *.env catch-all)
- Include pending hq/ and spec file updates

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
