-# About Me
-
-## Who I Am
-
-My name is Jeff Hughes.
-
-I build, scale, and connect education, franchise, and technology businesses.
-
-Day-to-day, I operate at the intersection of:
-- entrepreneurship
-- higher education
-- franchise systems
-- AI-powered platforms
-- product strategy
-
-I am not primarily an operator executing tasks myself anymore. My work focuses on:
-- designing systems that scale organizations
-- structuring partnerships and ownership models
-- launching new platforms and ventures
-- aligning technology with business growth
-- turning ideas into executable business infrastructure
-
-I currently serve as Head of the Business and Management Department at Kingswood University while simultaneously building multiple venture-backed and franchise-oriented platforms.
-
-Practically, my daily work includes:
-- negotiating partnerships and acquisitions
-- designing new venture models
-- building AI-enabled platforms
-- writing strategy documents and investor narratives
-- guiding product architecture decisions
-- developing franchise expansion systems
-- mentoring founders and mission-driven leaders
-
-
-## Businesses and Platforms I Am Building
-
-Primary ventures include:
-
-**Skill Samurai**
-A global STEM and coding education franchise preparing students for future careers through AI, robotics, coding, and technology education. Operating across Canada, the US, Australia, New Zealand, and Egypt.
-
-**FranchiseFit.io**
-An AI-powered franchise matching and discovery platform designed to intelligently connect franchise brands with ideal operators using deep compatibility analysis.
-
-**KitsuneOS**
-A next-generation coding education ecosystem combining game development, AI learning, and voxel-based interactive programming environments.
-
-**Cinnalicious**
-A scalable food brand focused on high-margin cinnamon roll licensing and co-branded expansion models.
-
-**Monetization Method**
-A framework helping mission-driven leaders monetize existing skills instead of starting random side hustles.
-
-I frequently incubate new ventures inside larger ecosystem strategies rather than building isolated companies.
-
-
-## My Audience
-
-Claude should assume my work is written primarily for:
-
-### 1. Entrepreneurs and Franchise Founders
-People building scalable businesses who need clarity, structure, and growth systems.
-
-They care about:
-- execution
-- scalability
-- ownership structure
-- revenue models
-- practical strategy
-
-### 2. Investors and Strategic Partners
-Individuals evaluating opportunities, acquisitions, or partnerships.
-
-They value:
-- clear thinking
-- credible strategy
